Z||000015||fieroshop||07-20-2000||11:29 PM||||I guess I'm an exception. I don't normally ask technical question but usually have the answer for people that are asking questions. I try to help where I can and some of you have bought parts from me. I will try to keep up my end and help where I can. Please feel free to call me on the land line and ask all the questions you feel that I might be able to answer.<BR>I personally do not mind somebody calling me at the shop as I prefer to answer your questions rather then read where you screwed up. I hate to see a Fiero mistreated as we both drive Fieros and I personnally own (besides my 88 GT) 10 Fieros and six parts cars or was it seven. But who's counting. <BR><P>------------------<BR> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif"> ||||reg||6
